  "integration_contract": "Merge the required body member and this $defs into each actual common-owned native schema, retaining the shared source-metadata-record shape and actual registered kind/schema_version. Ordinary HTTPS resource IDs come from the ACK. Do not use a fragment as a whole-Record schema or fabricate native IDs/pins.",
